				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Well I'm sure I&quot;ve met most of ye along yer journeys.. and well ye still wish t' know more? Eeeeps.
<br />

<br />
Hmm well its strange that there be not much t' tell.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
I would tell ye where I was born..if I indeed remember such an event. *she frowns* To be honest.. it as though m'life began at 15 when I awoke in the woodelf city of Kelethin. I know that is not where I was born.. for the spirits have told me so. 
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
However, I can seem to remember some of m' childhood.. though I never knew my father.. nor m' mum Analys since she died in birthin me. *she frowns once more.* But I know she was beautiful, of this I am sure.
<br />

<br />
m'grandmum Old Gladdys th' Druid took t' raisin me.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
She taught m' the early ways of th' druid..and that I had th' potential t' be a great one like my ancestors.. but woe is me if I could manage to get even one spell right!
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
M'grandmum passed on..but she lives in spirit..and even visits me in my dreams all th' time. *Grumbles.. particularly when my dreams are gettin good*
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Th' day after her burial.. I laid down t' sleep.. it was th' eve of my 15th birthday.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
I must have slept for days..even weeks perhaps.. and m'grandmum came t' me and told me I must take upon a new journey t' learn my ways..and my purpose.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
And that was when I awoke in Kelethin.. among so many of my own.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
The only strange thing be th' dragon's scar upon my right thigh.. it be etched into my skin.. like someone had used a skilled needle. *shrugs* I know not its origin or how it got there.. only that no amount of scrubbing makes it disappear.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
*chews on her lips*
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Well I'm oft known for my mishaps and sometimes m' silliness.. and particularly for th' fact that it takes a lot t' shut me up. 
<br />

<br />
Tis like m' mouth does nay know that m' brain is meant t' be th' one in control and.. errrr.. there I go again.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
In any case.. I am glad t' have found a place t' call home... th' worst thing about Kelethin and bein' so young was th' incredible loneliness... I think that be my greatest fear... errr.. well I hope t' meet ye all.. and I hope t' bring pride t' th' angelis name. 
<br />
<i>Edited by: Teleri of the Woods at: 1/30/02 10:55:42 am
<br />
</i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
